<title>SPAIN: EIB to give Repsol loan for 30 bln pta.</title>
<headline>EIB to give Repsol loan for 30 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol said on Monday it would receive 30 billion pesetas in loans from the European investment bank (EIB) to fund a number of projects.</p>
<p>In a statement Repsol said the loan, agreed in Madrid on Monday, would be paid in one or more tranches, in pesetas, or other currencies, included the euro.</p>
<p>Among recipients, Repsol oil will receive a loan for 10.6 billion pesetas, Repsol chemistry will receive 14 billion pesetas and Repsol Butano will get a loan for 5.4 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
